CONTEXT Registry IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Registry
{+ The population register of the example in the article on multi-context information systems.
It is a context of its own: it knows nothing of the contexts that include it. +}

RELATION name[Person*Name] [UNI,TOT]
RELATION address[Person*Address] [UNI]

POPULATION name[Person*Name] CONTAINS
  [ ("p1", "Peter")
  ; ("p2", "Melissa")
  ]
POPULATION address[Person*Address] CONTAINS
  [ ("p1", "Main Street 1")
  ]

RULE named : I[Person] |- name;name~
MEANING "Every person has a name."

ENDCONTEXT
